  "description": "The fastest .NET PDF library — 0.8ms mean, 5× faster than the industry leaders, 100% pass rate on 3,830 real-world PDFs. Idiomatic C# APIs for reading, creating, and editing PDFs: text extraction, format conversion (Markdown/HTML), element and annotation access, full-text search, and async operations.",
